OL,3,AFirst ministers of Wales, Scotland and
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland to meet in Cardiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,7,Fand Northern Ireland will meet in
OL,8,FCardiff on Monday to discuss "working
OL,9,Fmore closely" including on
OL,10,Fconstitutional issues.
OL,12,FIt will be the first face-to-face
OL,13,Fmeeting among the nationalist leaders
OL,14,Fsince Plaid Cymru's Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,15,Fwas elected in May, with all three
OL,16,Fwanting their countries to leave the
OL,17,FUnited Kingdom.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
